 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? The harder it is, the longer it keeps. So a roast or a big chunk of meat is better than chicken or fish. Ice cubes are great, but they melt slowly. A block of salted meat is even better. Keep it in a cool, dry place, not the fridge, and take it out an hour before serving. Put a note on the box, it' for the weekend and keep it out of reach. Yes, and add fresh water. It keeps it cool and keeps the food from going soggy.",
